    "signature": "fn longest_consecutive_prefix<T: Borrow<usize>>(sequence: impl IntoIterator<Item = T>) -> usize",
    "docs": "This function finds the longest prefix of the form 0, 1, 2, ... within the\ncollection `sequence`. Examples:\n- For 0, 1, 2, 4, 5; we would produce 3, meaning 0, 1, 2 is the longest satisfying\n  prefix.\n- For 1, 2, 3, 4; we would produce 0, meaning there is no such prefix.",
